  <section class="block" id="checklist">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="narrow center"><h2>Before Day One: Family Checklist</h2><p class="lead">A few minutes now will make the first morning of distance learning much smoother.</p></div>
      <div class="grid2" style="margin-top:28px">
        <div>
          <h3>All families</h3>
          <ul class="tick">
            <li>Check that the school holds your current contact details.</li>
            <li>Make sure your child’s device is charged, working and logs in to their school account.</li>
            <li>Agree a suitable workspace in a shared area of the home.</li>
            <li>Talk with your child about the <a href="/qe-at-home/online-safety">online expectations</a>.</li>
            <li>Note the Flourish booking window: 8:00am to 11:00am on the first morning.</li>
            <li>Tell us now if you need help with a device, access or an adjustment.</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Pre-Prep</h3>
          <ul class="tick">
            <li>Find the Seesaw student login code at the back of your child’s Reading Record.</li>
            <li>Plan for an adult to be available during live sessions, where possible.</li>
            <li>Have school uniform ready for live sessions.</li>
            <li>Collect your child’s whiteboard, markers, pencils and paper from school when they are made available.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Prep</h3>
          <ul class="tick">
            <li>Check your child can log in to Seesaw and the online tools their teacher uses.</li>
            <li>Keep the timetable somewhere visible.</li>
            <li>Keep the distance learning pack safe once it arrives.</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Senior School</h3>
          <ul class="tick">
            <li>Check your child can open their Teams calendar and Class Teams.</li>
            <li>Have QE PE kit ready, and headphones if useful.</li>
            <li>Make sure your child knows where to find the student self-referral form on Firefly.</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Students of Determination</h3>
          <ul class="tick"><li>Expect a call from the Elevate team before distance learning begins.</li></ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="block dark">
    <div class="wrap center narrow">
      <h2>Our Distance Learning Policy</h2>
      <p>This guide summarises our Distance Learning Policy, which reflects UAE federal and KHDA expectations alongside best practice in international remote education.</p>
      <p><a class="btn" href="https://www.qedubaisportscity.com/policies">View school policies</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
